App EcommercePlatform multi-cloud aws gcp

USE stripe PIN 1.2.3
USE elastic PIN 8.1.0
USE redis PIN 7.0.0
USE sendgrid PIN 2.0.0
USE kafka PIN 3.0.0
USE postgres PIN 3.0.0
USE s3 PIN 1.0.0

HAVE User with id uuid email string name string role enum addresses json
HAVE Product with id uuid sku string name string description text price decimal compare_at_price decimal inventory int category enum images json rating decimal reviews int created_at timestamp
HAVE Cart with id uuid user_id uuid items json total decimal expires_at timestamp
HAVE Order with id uuid user_id uuid items json total decimal tax decimal shipping decimal status enum payment_method string shipping_address json tracking string
HAVE PaymentIntent with id uuid order_id uuid amount decimal currency string stripe_id string status enum
HAVE Review with id uuid product_id uuid user_id uuid rating int title string body text images json
HAVE Coupon with id uuid code string discount_type enum discount_value decimal min_order decimal max_uses int used int expires_at timestamp
HAVE InventoryLog with id uuid product_id uuid change_type enum quantity int reason string
Have Notification with id uuid user_id uuid type enum title string body text read bool

Show ProductCatalog
Show ProductDetail
Show Cart
Show Checkout
Show OrderConfirmation
Show AdminDashboard
Show Analytics

Do AddToCart and idempotent circuit
 Call postgres.insert table = "carts" values = {user_id = Cart.user_id, product_id = Cart.product_id, quantity = Cart.quantity}
 Call redis.set key = "cart:{User.id}" value = Cart.items ttl 86400
 Do Audit and immutable
 Do Emit cart.updated

Do Checkout and idempotent circuit approval from 2 Finance
 Call postgres.update table = "carts" set = {status = "checking_out"} where = "id = Cart.id"
 Call stripe.create_payment_intent amount = Order.total currency = "usd" metadata = {order_id: Order.id}
 Call postgres.insert table = "payments" values = {order_id = Order.id, stripe_id = PaymentIntent.id, amount = Order.total, status = "requires_confirmation"}
 Call kafka.publish topic = "checkout.started" message = Order.id
 Do Audit and immutable
 Do Emit checkout.started

Do ConfirmPayment and idempotent circuit
 Call stripe.payment_intent_confirm stripe_id = PaymentIntent.id
 Call postgres.update table = "payments" set = {status = "succeeded"} where = "stripe_id = PaymentIntent.id"
 Call postgres.update table = "orders" set = {status = "confirmed", payment_id = PaymentIntent.id} where = "id = Order.id"
 Call inventory.decrement product_id = Order.items product_ids[].id quantity = Order.items product_ids[].quantity
 Call sendgrid.send template = "order_confirmation" to = User.email order = Order.id total = Order.total
 Call kafka.publish topic = "payment.succeeded" message = Order.id
 Do Audit and immutable
 Do Emit payment.confirmed

Do RefundOrder and idempotent circuit approval from 3 Support
 Call stripe.refund payment_intent = PaymentIntent.id amount = Refund.amount reason = Refund.reason
 Call postgres.update table = "refunds" set = {status = "processed", stripe_id = Refund.stripe_id} where = "id = Refund.id"
 Call postgres.update table = "orders" set = {status = "refunded"} where = "id = Order.id"
 Call inventory.increment product_id = Order.items product_ids[].id quantity = Order.items product_ids[].quantity
 Call sendgrid.send template = "refund_processed" to = User.email order = Order.id amount = Refund.amount
 Call kafka.publish topic = "order.refunded" message = Order.id
 Do Audit and immutable
 Do Emit order.refunded

Do RunAnalytics and bulk
 For each Product
  Call elastic.query index = "reviews" where = {product_id: Product.id} aggregate = "avg_rating"
  Call postgres.update table = "products" set = {rating = Review.avg_rating, reviews = Review.count} where = "id = Product.id"
 Call kafka.publish topic = "analytics.completed" message = "product_analytics"
 Do Audit and immutable
 Do Emit analytics.completed

Do GenerateReport and bulk approval from 1 Finance
 For each Order where Order.created_at >= Report.start_date and Order.created_at <= Report.end_date
  Call postgres.query "SELECT status, SUM(amount) FROM orders WHERE created_at BETWEEN $1 AND $2 GROUP BY status"
 Call elastic.index index = "reports" document = Report
 Call s3.upload bucket = "ataj-reports" key = "sales/{date}.csv" body = Report.data
 Call sendgrid.send template = "report_ready" to = Report.requestor attachment = Report.pdf
 Do Audit and immutable
 Do Emit report.completed

Do ArchiveOldOrders and idempotent
 For each Order where Order.status = "delivered" and Order.created_at < now() - 365 days
  Call postgres.archive table = "orders" where = "id = Order.id"
  Call s3.upload bucket = "ataj-archive" key = "orders/{Order.id}.json" body = Order.full_data
  Call postgres.delete table = "orders" where = "id = Order.id"
 Do Audit and immutable
 Do Emit orders.archived

Do GDPR delete user and audit
 Call postgres.anonymize table = "users" where = "user_id = GDPR.user_id"
 Call postgres.anonymize table = "orders" where = "user_id = GDPR.user_id"
 Call postgres.anonymize table = "carts" where = "user_id = GDPR.user_id"
 Call postgres.anonymize table = "reviews" where = "user_id = GDPR.user_id"
 Call elastic.delete_by_query index = "users" query = {user_id: GDPR.user_id}
 Do Audit and immutable
 Do Emit user.deleted

When daily Do CleanupExpiredCarts and bulk
 For each Cart where Cart.expires_at < now() and Cart.status = "active" do
  Call redis.delete key = "cart:{Cart.user_id}"
  Call postgres.delete table = "carts" where = "id = Cart.id"
 Do Audit and immutable
 Do Emit cleanup.expired_carts

When 1st of month Do MonthlyBilling and bulk
 For each Tenant do GenerateInvoice
 Call usage.calculate tenant_id = Tenant.id feature_set = TenantPlan.features
 Call invoice.create tenant_id = Tenant.id amount = Usage.total period = BillingRun.period
 Do Audit and immutable
 Do Emit billing.completed